;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Just then, from nowhere, an eerie, heavy, unearthly sound rang out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This... is the same sound we heard at Toyotake Station...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa... this sound again...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you know this sound?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, today I went all the way out toward Toyotake Station looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and I heard a sound just like it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> were there too, back then..."</STYLE><PG>
At Toyotake Station, right after that eerie sound, a cherry tree had suddenly appeared on the tracks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could something ominous have happened again?
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
